<title>POLAND: KPBP BICK INCREASES 1997 NET FORECAST.</title>
<headline>KPBP BICK INCREASES 1997 NET FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company KPBP Bick SA has increased its 1997 net profit forecast to 2.65 million zlotys from 2.5 million announced earlier, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It also increased its sales forecast to 94 million zlotys from 80.5 million zlotys forecast earlier. KPBP Bick netted 2.1 milllion zlotys on 78.4-million-zloty sales in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
